{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Tech is a cozy survival adventure about hiking and camping your way to Grandma\u2019s house. <strong>Wishlist today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hike  to move closer to Grandma, but try not to turn your journey into a cautionary tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.poster.avif?t=1762301484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.webm?t=1762301484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.mp4?t=1762301484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up camp to rest, and explore to gather resources to prepare for the journey ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.poster.avif?t=1762301484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.webm?t=1762301484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.mp4?t=1762301484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your survival skills with mini-games: navigate using the stars or the rising sun, or be delayed on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/3da31d616aaffe07d97cb3fa004d9fca.avif?t=1762301484\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep visiting Grandma to earn new tools and skills, and carry them into your next run until the day she deems you ready for grander adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/830b6af24801000d5caa276a5ab3a0c4.avif?t=1762301484\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If players enjoy this  hike, the adventure may expand into new biomes and the survival systems  connected to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stretch Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated exploration areas</strong>: larger areas around camp to explore with greater risks and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation &amp; deduction</strong>: use natural signs to guess what's around. For example, cattails hint at water nearby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Even more plants, animals, and encounters</strong>: a wider variety of discoveries in the wild, from the nourishing to the whimsical to the dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New biomes</strong>: trek through deserts,  mountains, jungles,  coastlines, and more. One day, unlock Real-World Survival Mode: generate journeys between actual locations on a world map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976010?t=1762301484","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976010?t=1762301484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/e352bf07882788f201353ae2a9a6582ed65e430c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762301484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/e352bf07882788f201353ae2a9a6582ed65e430c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762301484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Tech is a cozy survival adventure about hiking and camping your way to Grandma\u2019s house. <strong>Wishlist today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hike  to move closer to Grandma, but try not to turn your journey into a cautionary tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.poster.avif?t=1762301484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.webm?t=1762301484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/722d2d33614918db649da90a037ca58d.mp4?t=1762301484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up camp to rest, and explore to gather resources to prepare for the journey ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.poster.avif?t=1762301484\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.webm?t=1762301484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/f15b942499a764b0fa9288150154ef0e.mp4?t=1762301484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your survival skills with mini-games: navigate using the stars or the rising sun, or be delayed on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/3da31d616aaffe07d97cb3fa004d9fca.avif?t=1762301484\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep visiting Grandma to earn new tools and skills, and carry them into your next run until the day she deems you ready for grander adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/extras/830b6af24801000d5caa276a5ab3a0c4.avif?t=1762301484\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If players enjoy this  hike, the adventure may expand into new biomes and the survival systems  connected to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stretch Goals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated exploration areas</strong>: larger areas around camp to explore with greater risks and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation &amp; deduction</strong>: use natural signs to guess what's around. For example, cattails hint at water nearby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Even more plants, animals, and encounters</strong>: a wider variety of discoveries in the wild, from the nourishing to the whimsical to the dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New biomes</strong>: trek through deserts,  mountains, jungles,  coastlines, and more. One day, unlock Real-World Survival Mode: generate journeys between actual locations on a world map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["truckbot"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976010/24004d09e1fca23162ced3a974c74d1c739f4484/header.jpg?t=1762301484","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976010/2074487679/ab74959fcb5560f5bf24f3d871f6573f910fda58/1762298796/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762299013","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976010/2074487679/ab74959fcb5560f5bf24f3d871f6573f910fda58/1762298796/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762299013","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3976010/2074487679/ab74959fcb5560f5bf24f3d871f6573f910fda58/1762298796/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762299013","id":257226903,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257226903/movie480.mp4?t=1762299013","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257226903/movie_max.mp4?t=1762299013"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226903/fb27cdc0e04010a7302ce904d4cc4ecf56878452/movi